# Host/protocol canonicalization + language trees are handled by
# netlify/edge-functions/i18n.js (Accept-Language + cipi-lang cookie).
# Static fallbacks below cover crawlers if the edge function is unavailable.
# /en uses English slugs; /it uses Italian slugs.

# Redirect installer URLs to GitHub raw (avoids 500 when hosting can't serve .sh)
/setup.sh  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cipi-sh/cipi/refs/heads/latest/setup.sh  302

# Retired sponsorship pages → language home (edge function then picks /en or /it)
